{"product_id":"the-van-alen-legacy-blue-bloods-book-4","title":"The Van Alen Legacy (Blue Bloods, Book 4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith the stunning revelation surrounding Bliss's true identity comes the growing threat of the sinister Silver Bloods. Once left to live the glamorous life in New York City, the Blue Bloods now find themselves in an epic battle for survival. Not to worry, love is still in the air for the young vampires of the Upper East Side. Or is it? Jack and Schuyler are over. Oliver's brokenhearted. And only the cunning Mimi seems to be happily engaged.Young, fanged, and fabulous, Melissa de la Cruz's vampires unite in the fourth installment of the best-selling Blue Bloods series.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Melissa De La Cruz\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781423102267\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 384\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45169084039321,"sku":"3RC9781423102267","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67b98eec3fe92_The_20Van_20Alen_20Legacy_20_Blue_20Bloods_20Book_204_20Melissa_20De_20La_20Cruz.jpg?v=1752084598","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-van-alen-legacy-blue-bloods-book-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}